│   ├── hooks.py
│   └── modules.txt
├── pyproject.toml
└── README.md
```

## Installation

1. Set up Frappe Bench.
2. Get the Library Management app.
3. Install the app on your Frappe site.
4. Run database migrations.
5. Start the Bench server.

## Learning Outcomes

- Understanding Frappe DocTypes.
- Understanding Child DocTypes and parent-child relationships.
- Implementing Python Framework Controllers.
- Working with document lifecycle methods.
- Implementing validations and business logic.

